cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper whose result you use, and — if you use the code itself — this repository."
title: "Normalized Uncertainty: measures of uncertainty and directional risk from survey density forecasts"
abstract: "Implementation of Normalized Uncertainty (NU), Normalized Growth Uncertainty (NGU) and Asymmetry Coherence (AC), measures that remove from survey forecast dispersion the part explained by the distance of expected inflation from the announced target, together with the scripts reproducing the public-data exhibits of the papers 'Uncertain and Asymmetric Forecasts' and 'Tolerable Inflation, Intolerable Uncertainty'."
type: software
